{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110774","id":2848721307,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6pzAmb","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110774","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110774.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110774.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110774","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110774/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110774/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110774/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/386253334da6b8e636fd6c7456639de0d87322da","number":110774,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Booleanize values before logical operators","user":{"login":"StamLord","id":42681607,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNjgxNjA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42681607?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord","html_url":"https://github.com/StamLord","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/StamLord/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This is an attempt to fix https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108813\r\n\r\nIssue:\r\nInconsistent behavior when using logical operators on constants/literals and on variants:\r\n\r\n```\r\nprint(42 and \"hello\") # Error: Invalid operands to operator or, int and String\r\n\r\nvar a = 42\r\nvar b = \"hello\"\r\nprint(a and b) # prints \"true\"\r\n```\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\n- Values are boolenized before calling `Variant::evaluate` in both `expression.cpp` and `gdscript_analyzer.cpp`\r\n- Booleanize both values when operators are `AND`, `OR`, `XOR`\r\n- Booleanize only first value if operator is `NOT`\r\n- For other operators, values are left as is.\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","description":"","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an und